    "type": "game",
    "name": "Combat Pay",
    "steam_appid": 3803670,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this PVE third person extraction shooter, you will embark on contracts in a galaxy at war where the money you earn can be used to purchase upgrades like weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose which contracts you want to complete.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a galaxy at war, Choose contracts from a variety of diverse factions. There are many different mission types which will range from defending points from invaders to hunting down dangerous enemies</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Large Open Battlefields</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world is dominated by an endless war between factions which evolves and changes with or without you. Choose to actively participate in these conflicts, or to complete your own jobs for neutral factions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt to new threats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to determine how to best deal with the threats you come across. Whether it be enemy soldiers, tanks, mechs, or even air vehicles. If the job requires that you kill it, you must figure out how.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Diverse Factions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factions range from planetary militias, to corporate security forces outfitted with high end military gear, all the way to Religious Zealots hell bent on the eradication of AI technology</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803670/extras/ea7bb2c6e3ac3ef8036157e73e50b3fe.poster.avif?t=1753778013\" width=606 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803670/extras/ea7bb2c6e3ac3ef8036157e73e50b3fe.webm?t=1753778013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803670/extras/ea7bb2c6e3ac3ef8036157e73e50b3fe.mp4?t=1753778013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High Stakes Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat will be deadly and punishing and every bolt that is shot at you can be your last. Make smart tactical decisions or risk being caught by dangerous enemies and gunned down where you stand. Beware, all items kept on you at the time of your death will be lost if not recovered by your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803670/extras/511a1c08cbccb0f5925b013725b8102a.poster.avif?t=1753778013\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803670/extras/511a1c08cbccb0f5925b013725b8102a.webm?t=1753778013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803670/extras/511a1c08cbccb0f5925b013725b8102a.mp4?t=1753778013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get the right tools for the job</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machine guns to better suppress enemy positions, target locaters that can call orbital bombardments, Jetpacks, and even friendly units which you can command. Once you make enough credits, you will be able to purchase all this and more from your base's terminal. All goods delivered courtesy of CosmoCo.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this PVE third person extraction shooter, you will embark on contracts in a galaxy at war where the money you earn can be used to purchase upgrades like weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose which contracts you want to complete.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a galaxy at war, Choose contracts from a variety of diverse factions. There are many different mission types which will range from defending points from invaders to hunting down dangerous enemies</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Large Open Battlefields</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each world is dominated by an endless war between factions which evolves and changes with or without you. Choose to actively participate in these conflicts, or to complete your own jobs for neutral factions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adapt to new threats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to determine how to best deal with the threats you come across. Whether it be enemy soldiers, tanks, mechs, or even air vehicles. If the job requires that you kill it, you must figure out how.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Diverse Factions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Factions range from planetary militias, to corporate security forces outfitted with high end military gear, all the way to Religious Zealots hell bent on the eradication of AI technology</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803670/extras/ea7bb2c6e3ac3ef8036157e73e50b3fe.poster.avif?t=1753778013\" width=606 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803670/extras/ea7bb2c6e3ac3ef8036157e73e50b3fe.webm?t=1753778013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803670/extras/ea7bb2c6e3ac3ef8036157e73e50b3fe.mp4?t=1753778013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >High Stakes Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat will be deadly and punishing and every bolt that is shot at you can be your last. Make smart tactical decisions or risk being caught by dangerous enemies and gunned down where you stand. Beware, all items kept on you at the time of your death will be lost if not recovered by your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803670/extras/511a1c08cbccb0f5925b013725b8102a.poster.avif?t=1753778013\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803670/extras/511a1c08cbccb0f5925b013725b8102a.webm?t=1753778013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803670/extras/511a1c08cbccb0f5925b013725b8102a.mp4?t=1753778013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get the right tools for the job</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machine guns to better suppress enemy positions, target locaters that can call orbital bombardments, Jetpacks, and even friendly units which you can command. Once you make enough credits, you will be able to purchase all this and more from your base's terminal. All goods delivered courtesy of CosmoCo.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "short_description": "In this Co-op tactical shooter, you will complete dangerous jobs for warring factions in a perpetual warzone. Purchase upgrades, equipment and friendly units to assist you in completing more difficult jobs.",
